n></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ 관생실 배정공고 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">파일 첨부</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></span> 입사 준비물 및 방법 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 신분증 : 주민등록증, 운전면허증, 여권 중 택 1 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(학생증 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 개인 비품 : 침구류, 세면도구 등 개인 생활 용품</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 입실 방법 : 입사 등록 후 입실</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></span> 입사 등록</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 절차 : 본인확인 → 열쇠 수령 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 일정 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2015. 6. 21(일) 14:00~18:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 장소 : 푸름관-3동 현관, 오름관-식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 입사 기간 및 시간 이후 입사 : 푸름관-3동 경비실, 오름관-방재실</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></span> 식수 혈관 등록</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -68.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 시간 : </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사일 14:00～18:00, 각 관 식사시간(입사 기간 외에는 식사시간에 등록)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 장소 : 각 관 식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 방법 : 신분증 제시 후 식수 혈관 등록</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 식사 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">6.21(일) 저녁부터 제공 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">*오름관 : </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">8월25일 조식까지 제공</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; *푸름관 : 8월 16일 석식까지 제공</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HSty